{"id":4986,"date":"2018-09-14T09:02:25","date_gmt":"2018-09-14T13:02:25","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=4986"},"modified":"2018-09-14T09:02:27","modified_gmt":"2018-09-14T13:02:27","slug":"a-different-nights-stay","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2018\/09\/14\/a-different-nights-stay\/","title":{"rendered":"A different night&#8217;s stay"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>So after a peaceful nights stay with Butch and Fonda, it was another 4 or 5 hour drive south west out of Indiana and into Illinois where we spent a noisy night behind a Cracker Barrel just east of St. Louis, MO.<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4984 alignnone size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/09\/20180913_191416452654381430405765.jpg\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/09\/20180913_191416452654381430405765.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/09\/20180913_191416452654381430405765-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/09\/20180913_191416452654381430405765-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/09\/20180913_191416452654381430405765-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>I write this as Kathy is up and in the shower, (I have of course been up for over 90 minutes!).<\/p>\n<p>We said last night that she&#8217;d not bother preparing the coffee as the restaurant opens at 7am and I would just walk over and buy a couple large ones in the morning.<\/p>\n<p>I forgot about the time change though .. when my body said it was 6:30 and time to get up, it was really only .. you guessed it &#8211; 5:30 and Cracker Barrel doesn&#8217;t open until 7am!<\/p>\n<p>So now it&#8217;s 8 o&#8217;clock my time, the restaurant just opened, I can smell the bacon wafting out the kitchen ventilation system, and I&#8217;M HUNGRY!!<\/p>\n<p>Just heard the shower door close, so we&#8217;re getting closer.<\/p>\n<p>There&#8217;s a Super 8 next door and so our nights rest was often interrupted by truckers and others pulling in for their nights rest.<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-4985\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/09\/20180913_1913501396751864927127044.jpg\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/09\/20180913_1913501396751864927127044.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/09\/20180913_1913501396751864927127044-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/09\/20180913_1913501396751864927127044-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/09\/20180913_1913501396751864927127044-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>But we had the windows cracked and the ceiling exhaust fan on bringing in the cool night air through the windows, and we were tired enough that eventually we fell asleep.<\/p>\n<p>Weve finished our breakfast and now to move on.<\/p>\n<figure style=\"width: 2560px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/09\/20180914_0741438157316858214458181.jpg\" class=\"wp-image-4990 size-full\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/09\/20180914_0741438157316858214458181.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/09\/20180914_0741438157316858214458181-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/09\/20180914_0741438157316858214458181-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/09\/20180914_0741438157316858214458181-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">Yes, this is BOTH our breakfasts, just wanted to make that clear!<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>Now we&#8217;re moving on to Springfield, MO where we&#8217;ll visit the huge <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"http:\/\/www.wondersofwildlife.org\">BASS PRO SHOPS<\/a> Museum.  More to come on that later<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>So after a peaceful nights stay with Butch and Fonda, it was another 4 or 5 hour drive south west out of Indiana and into Illinois where we spent a noisy night behind a Cracker Barrel just east of St. Louis, MO. I write this as Kathy is up and in the shower, (I have &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2018\/09\/14\/a-different-nights-stay\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">A different night&#8217;s stay<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[554707329],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-4986","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-traveling"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4986","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=4986"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4986\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":4991,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4986\/revisions\/4991"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=4986"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=4986"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=4986"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}